# Rust build artifacts — the workspace-root `target/` rule already covers this
# crate; this unanchored rule also covers standalone builds such as the
# non-member fuzz/ package.
target/

# Cargo.lock is tracked at the workspace root — not ignored for this crate —
# and fuzz/Cargo.lock is committed on purpose.

# Editor / OS junk
*.swp
*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
